OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker asked man 'do you
OL,4,Awant to die?', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers fled "in sheer terror"
OL,7,Ffrom a knife attacker who asked one
OL,8,Fvictim "do you want to die?", a trial
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FJurors were shown CCTV footage of
OL,12,Fpassenger Stephen Crean attempting to
OL,13,Fdisarm Anthony Williams during the
OL,14,Fattack on the Doncaster to King's Cross
OL,15,Ftrain at Huntingdon on 1 November last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
