OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker asked man 'do you
OL,4,Awant to die?', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the prosecution case at
OL,7,FCambridge Crown Court, Christopher
OL,8,FPaxton KC said that of those on the
OL,9,Ftrain "some stood tall, to protect
OL,10,Fothers trying to de-escalate his
OL,11,Frampage".
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, is accused of attempting
OL,14,Fto murder 10 train passengers and
OL,15,Fstaff. He is also accused of trying to
OL,16,Fkill three people in Peterborough the
OL,17,Fday before and then a boy at a London
OL,18,Frailway station.
